sequenceDiagram
    participant Ch as Channel
    participant Rt as Routing
    participant LM as Lane Manager
    participant SP as System Prompt Builder
    participant AR as Agent Runtime (Pi)
    participant TP as Tool Policy
    participant Mem as Memory
    participant UO as User/Operator

    Ch->>Rt: Incoming message
    Rt->>Rt: resolveAgentRoute()<br/>(cascade: peer, guild, team,<br/>account, wildcard, default)
    Rt->>LM: Request lane (Main/Subagent/Cron)
    LM->>LM: FIFO queue if at capacity

    LM->>SP: Lane acquired
    SP->>SP: buildEmbeddedSystemPrompt()<br/>(docs + tools + skills + hooks)
    SP->>AR: Start run

    AR->>TP: Tool call request
    TP->>UO: exec.approval.request<br/>(if policy = 'ask')
    UO->>TP: Approve / Deny
    TP->>AR: Execute tool

    AR->>Mem: Pre-compaction check<br/>(shouldRunMemoryFlush)
    Mem->>Mem: Silent flush turn<br/>if threshold crossed

    AR->>Ch: Response<br/>(chunked per channel limit)
